        question([0], [1, 2], "Who assumes responsibility by issuing the EU declaration?", "Does a supplier certificate replace the provider's Article 47 declaration?", ("The provider issuing the declaration remains responsible.", "Article 47 assigns the declaration and compliance responsibility to the provider."), ("Only the model supplier, irrespective of the system built.", "The provider's system duties are not transferred by buying a model."), ("Only the graphic designer who formats the document.", "Formatting does not determine the responsible declarant.")),
        question([1], [3, 4], "A declaration says only 'AI compliant' and names no traceable system. What is missing?", "Why is a generic conformity slogan insufficient for Annex V?", ("The required identification, statements, references and signatory details.", "Annex V specifies declaration content for an identifiable system."), ("Only a larger logo.", "A logo does not supply the required declaration fields."), ("Nothing if a certificate exists somewhere.", "A certificate is not a substitute for complete declaration content.")),
