        question([1], [2, 3], "A registration record identifies only the commercial model. What is missing?", "What identity must the high-risk registration record make traceable?", ("The actual AI system and its required purpose, status and evidence fields.", "Annex VIII Section A concerns the registered system, not only its model."), ("Only the marketing team's preferred colour.", "Colour does not establish the required system record."), ("Nothing if the supplier is well known.", "Supplier fame does not replace required system information.")),
        question([2], [4, 5], "A provider supports an Article 6(3) exclusion for an Annex III-listed system. Is registration automatically waived?", "Which registration branch applies to a supported non-high-risk conclusion under Article 6(3)?", ("Register the provider and system with the Section B record.", "Article 49(2) retains this duty; it is distinct from ordinary minimal risk."), ("No registration or documented assessment is ever needed.", "The exclusion retains documentation and registration duties."), ("Restore deleted Section B fields from an old template.", "The current baseline's deletions must be respected.")),
