        question([0], [3, 4, 5], "A lawful point 1 system is used in the specified asylum context. Which destination rule needs checking?", "Does the specified authority-use context change the ordinary EU database destination?", ("The secure non-public section with its specified fields and access limits.", "Article 49(4) defines this restricted branch."), ("Always publish every confidential field on a marketing website.", "That ignores the secure-record and access conditions."), ("Skip every record because the use is sensitive.", "Restricted registration is not the absence of registration.")),
        question([1], [1, 2], "A public authority buys Northbridge's registered system. What separate duty must it check?", "Does the provider's entry necessarily complete the public deployer's record?", ("Its own pre-use registration and applicable assessment summaries.", "Article 49(3) and Annex VIII Section C concern the deployer's use."), ("None; a provider URL replaces every public-deployer obligation.", "The two actor records have distinct purposes."), ("Every private customer must submit identical public-authority records.", "The particular paragraph does not cover every ordinary private deployer.")),
